  "description": "The IVG Smart Max Prefilled Pod Vape Kit combines intelligent design with an extended pod capacity to deliver a great value device with which to enjoy some of 12000 IVG's most popular flavours. Built around a powerful 1000mAh rechargeable battery, the Smart Max 12K features a clear digital display and two distinct performance modes — Eco Mode for everyday efficiency, and Boost Mode for a fuller, more intense vape. Each Smart Max pod contains 2ml of e-liquid and pairs with an integrated 10ml refill reservoir. The refill chamber automatically feeds the pod as you vape, potentially supporting up to 10,000 puffs in total (depending upon personal vaping style.) This design eliminates the need for manual refilling or coil changes while maintaining excellent flavour and vapour consistency thanks to the built-in mesh coil. The device is optimised for MTL (mouth-to-lung) vaping, delivering smooth, satisfying nicotine delivery with discreet vapour and minimal fuss. With a simple plug-and-play setup and a wide selection of expertly blended IVG Smart Max refill pod flavours to choose from, the IVG Smart Max 12K prefilled pod vape kit is an excellent choice for vapers looking for performance, simplicity, and convenience in one dependable kit. IVG Smart Max Kit Flavours • Banana Ice – Sweet Banana with a brisk, cooling finish. • Blue Raspberry Ice – Tangy Blue Raspberry balanced by cool Menthol. • Blue Razz Lemonade – Blue Raspberry with a fizzy Lemonade twist. • Blue Sour Raspberry – A tart blend of sharp Blue Raspberry notes. • Blueberry Raspberry – A sweet-berry pairing of Blueberry and Raspberry. • Classic Menthol – Clean and brisk Menthol with a simple finish. • Cola Ice – Familiar Cola with a cool, refreshing edge. • Fizzy Cherry – Sweet Cherry layered with subtle sparkling tang. • Frozen Cherry – Juicy Cherry overlaid with a chilled Menthol kick. • Frozen Watermelon – Fresh Watermelon with a crisp, icy finish. • Grape – Bold, juicy Grape with rich fruit character. • Green Apple – Sharp Green Apple with a tangy-sweet bite. • Lemon and Lime – A citrus duet of zesty Lemon and bright Lime. • Pineapple Ice – Sweet Pineapple with a brisk Menthol exhale. • Polar Mint – A cool, punchy Mint flavour. • Retro Orange – Juicy Orange with nostalgic soda pop character. • Strawberry Raspberry Cherry – A sweet medley of summer berry favourites. • Triple Mango – A deep, juicy Mango trio with tropical flavour. • Tropical Fruits – A vibrant mix of tropical fruit flavours. • Watermelon Strawberry – Sweet Watermelon blended with juicy Strawberry. Shop IVG Smart Max Refill Pods",
